  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.CardanoOASIS v2.0.5\n\nConnects the OASIS to Cardano -- a peer-reviewed, research-first proof-of-stake blockchain with Ouroboros consensus and Plutus smart contracts. Stores OASIS holons, avatars, and metadata on Cardano with energy-efficient PoS security. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.4\n- Derive real MultiversX and Cardano keys; share Bech32 and SLIP-10 (9fa7d2f)\n- HoloNET: keep Chaos.NaCl private and ship its DLL in the Cardano/Hashgraph provider packages (no dependency on the nonexistent NuGet Chaos.NaCl 1.0.0); live release script uses the dedicated legacy-hApp fixture in HoloNET Client.Tests/Fixtures (4afe222)\n- MOVING DOCS AROUND (32a8004)\n- Select verified Cardano CQL demo release without unqualified TRON work (122d443)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Blockchain/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.CardanoOASIS",
